{"title": "Moonlight Glaive: Glowing", "pageid": 28048, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Moonlight_Glaive:_Glowing", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features", "Toggleable passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Light.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Light.webp/300px-Light.webp, /w/images/e/e2/Light.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Light.webp/300px-Light.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Light.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Moonlight Glaive: Glowing</b> is a toggleable passive feature that causes this object to glow.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This object shines with a glowing light in a radius of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"6 m (20 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠6 m (20 ft). \n</p><p>Toggle this to douse and rekindle the light.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Light\"> Condition: Light </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_(Condition)\" title=\"Light (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Light_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light_(Condition)\" title=\"Light (Condition)\">Light</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>This object has an aura of light with a radius of 7.5 m (25 ft).</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonlight_Glaive\" title=\"Moonlight Glaive\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Glaive_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Moonlight_Glaive\" title=\"Moonlight Glaive\">Moonlight Glaive</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200528\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1399/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11542/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2495/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 873216/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.402      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   45.402      1 -total\n 27.91%   12.673      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 23.47%   10.654      2 Template:Icon_text\n 22.73%   10.319     12 Template:Trim\n 20.66%    9.380      1 Template:Radius\n 18.36%    8.336      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 17.82%    8.089      4 Template:Ifempty\n 16.53%    7.507      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 15.29%    6.943      1 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3w